     }
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": 16,
     "after": {
      "frame": "GO"
     }
    }
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: its aerial starts. X or Y",
   "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: R, the stick back and a little down: the wavedash back",
   "GO": "Frame {GO}: its aerial has missed. Dash in"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "Out from under it",
    "text": [
     "{opp} jumps in with its {attack}, aimed at where Fox stands. A wavedash back is a jump and an air dodge into the ground on Fox's first frame in the air: he slides away, still facing {opp}.",
     "The aerial comes down on empty ground."
    ],
